{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122164517490-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122173651\"/><p>消防拖喉灌救。</p><p>西環發生火警。今午(22日)3時42分，山道63號富山苑及昌運大廈間的一條後巷懷疑失火，不斷冒出白煙。消防接報到場，派出一隊煙帽隊及開動一條喉灌救，迅即將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，毋須疏散。消息指，火警懷疑涉及電掣起火焫着雜物，並無可疑。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:43:51.695253+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:45:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:17:16.605695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:37:26.478905+00:00","content_hash":"04b77277b501c2399a5304f2e551a9e7109900830fc7343d9a1f91826816279a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}